  "statuteText": "266:62 School Bus Design Rules. –\n\nThe director shall adopt pursuant to RSA 260:5 and enforce all needful rules to govern the design of all school buses used for the transportation of school children when owned and operated by any school district, publicly or privately owned, or operated while under contract in this state."
